    M\u0130KROB\u0130YOLOJ\u0130K / F\u0130Z\u0130KSEL ANAL\u0130Z: UYGUN \u2014
    Numunenin tazelik, renk ve doku de\u011Ferleri standartlara uygun.\r\n\u2022
    \u0130\xC7ER\u0130K & T\xDCR DO\u011ERULAMASI: UYUMSUZ (TAKL\u0130T / TA\u011E\u015E\u0130\u015E)
